  message: "2026-10-20 docstring audit, verifier repro: a second scheme shape with the same effect. A variable define bound to a lambda drops its calls: the variable-define branch of _extract_scheme_edges returns without walking the value, and the call has no enclosing function symbol, so (define f (lambda (y) (helper y))) emits no edge to helper. (Separate defect filed as WI-furid? no -- see the let-binding item: let pairs emitted as calls.)"  # 8a70
